  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Asynchronous Performance: High-throughput, channel-based logging engine designed for non-blocking execution under extreme horizontal load.\n- Structured Target System: Pluggable sinks including high-speed batched file I/O, optimized console output, and multi-channel message routing.\n- Batching & Efficiency: Minimized disk contention through advanced batch file writing and configurable buffering strategies.\n- Unified Facade: Simplified NLogix access points for seamless, context-aware logging across all Nalix-based applications.",
